(1)   86/   0 :                                                         ;   display kernel polls THIS and not INTIM:
(1)   87/   0 :                                                         ;   past zero INTIM free-runs at a tick a
(1)   88/   0 :                                                         ;   cycle and a poll can walk straight over it
